Job Responsibilities
Preparing stores requisitions;
Updating the stores /stocks cards;
Checking the stationery issued against requisition made;
Preparing stores requisitions for the items which have reached their minimum stock levels
Ensuring the quality of goods delivered by suppliers are of the right/required quality;
Delivering stores to other departments/divisions;
Preparing payment vouchers for suppliers
